      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然又是同样的话，\n不过还是要说，我在做<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n彩色隐形眼镜的设计哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713653C8662F540C683776848BDDFF0C000A4E0D8FC78FD8662F89818BF4FF0C62115728505A00100001BE00000A5F69827296905F62773C955C76848BBE8BA154E6FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "前阵子我听客人说，\n恰雷姆把瑜伽钻研到了极致，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这也太厉害了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "524D96355B506211542C5BA24EBA8BF4FF0C000A607096F759C6628A745C4F3D94BB781452304E86678181F4FF0C00100001BE00000A8FD94E5F592A53895BB34E865427FF1F00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "擅长“瑜伽”的恰雷姆超级进化后就会……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64C5957F201C745C4F3D201D7684607096F759C68D857EA78FDB5316540E5C314F1A2026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……“愈加”进化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026201C610852A0201D8FDB5316300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～好想看好想看！\n我好想看超级恰雷姆！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5E597D60F3770B597D60F3770BFF01000A6211597D60F3770B8D857EA7607096F759C6FF01FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最后一场对战，\n让我看看恰雷姆的超级进化吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700540E4E00573A5BF96218FF0C000A8BA96211770B770B607096F759C676848D857EA78FDB53165427FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带一提，恰雷姆的超级石\n能够在石头馆买到哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E264E0063D0FF0C607096F759C676848D857EA777F3000A80FD591F572877F3593499864E70523054E6300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最后我想看超级恰雷姆！\n把恰雷姆放进同行队伍吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700540E621160F3770B8D857EA7607096F759C6FF01000A628A607096F759C6653E8FDB540C884C961F4F0D5427300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最后我想看超级恰雷姆！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但你却没有让\n恰雷姆携带超级石！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700540E621160F3770B8D857EA7607096F759C6FF0100100001BE01000A4F464F6053746CA167098BA9000A607096F759C6643A5E268D857EA777F3FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "跟我来一场对战，\n让我看看超级恰雷姆吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
